{"id":"f718fe4d6ccbe5e9","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-index-not-self-dual.md","title":"外延指标集不可能自对偶","display":"thm-index-not-self-dual — 外延指标集不可能自对偶","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-index-not-self-dual","aliases":["20-thm-index-not-self-dual"],"display":"thm-index-not-self-dual — 外延指标集不可能自对偶","chapter":"2","section":"2.2","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Exercise 2.2.10(a)","source_printed_pages":[33],"source_pdf_pages":[69],"depends_on":["[[20-df-index-set]]","[[20-df-self-dual]]","[[20-thm-recursion]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-index-not-self-dual"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-index-not-self-dual</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-index-not-self-dual — 外延指标集不可能自对偶"},{"key":"chapter","html":"2"},{"key":"section","html":"2.2"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Exercise 2.2.10(a)"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>33</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>69</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f0ae2cb21680ca8b\" href=\"?note=f0ae2cb21680ca8b\" title=\"20-df-index-set\">20-df-index-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"21545eb20080c3e0\" href=\"?note=21545eb20080c3e0\" title=\"20-df-self-dual\">20-df-self-dual</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"416559051d6f8f46\" href=\"?note=416559051d6f8f46\" title=\"20-thm-recursion\">20-thm-recursion</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{IndexSet}(A)\">\\(\\operatorname{IndexSet}(A)\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f0ae2cb21680ca8b\" href=\"?note=f0ae2cb21680ca8b\" title=\"20-df-index-set\">20-df-index-set</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"21545eb20080c3e0\" href=\"?note=21545eb20080c3e0\" title=\"20-df-self-dual\">20-df-self-dual</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"416559051d6f8f46\" href=\"?note=416559051d6f8f46\" title=\"20-thm-recursion\">20-thm-recursion</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}index\\text{-}not\\text{-}self\\text{-}dual}\\vdash\n\\neg\\operatorname{SelfDual}(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}index\\text{-}not\\text{-}self\\text{-}dual}\\vdash\n\\neg\\operatorname{SelfDual}(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>若 A≤mĀ 由全可计算 f 见证，则 n∈A 当且仅当 f(n)∉A。递归定理给 φ_n=φ_f(n)，外延指标性却要求两索引同属或同不属 A，矛盾。这个论证也包含平凡指标集。</p>\n<p>来源：Exercise 2.2.10(a)；印刷页 33；PDF 第 69 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-index-set","status":"resolved","id":"f0ae2cb21680ca8b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-index-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-self-dual","status":"resolved","id":"21545eb20080c3e0","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-self-dual]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-recursion","status":"resolved","id":"416559051d6f8f46","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-recursion]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-index-set","status":"resolved","id":"f0ae2cb21680ca8b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-index-set]]；see [[20-df-self-dual]]；see [[20-thm-recursion]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-self-dual","status":"resolved","id":"21545eb20080c3e0","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-index-set]]；see [[20-df-self-dual]]；see [[20-thm-recursion]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-recursion","status":"resolved","id":"416559051d6f8f46","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-index-set]]；see [[20-df-self-dual]]；see [[20-thm-recursion]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{IndexSet}(A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}index\\text{-}not\\text{-}self\\text{-}dual}\\vdash\n\\neg\\operatorname{SelfDual}(A).","display":true}],"bytes":1176,"backlinks":[{"id":"005203b6707a19f4","anchor":"ref-82","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-thm-index-not-self-dual]] — 章 2；直接提供者 3 个。"},{"id":"f4368dd1e05cad1f","anchor":"ref-82","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-thm-index-not-self-dual]]"}],"outgoing":["f0ae2cb21680ca8b","21545eb20080c3e0","416559051d6f8f46"]}